WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.220
Because it is Christmas today,
as far as we're concerned,

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:07.490
we thought we'd indulge in a
very special holiday tradition

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:09.810
and read a Christmas tale.

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:11.290
This one's slightly updated.

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:14.790
It's called "'Twas a
While Before Christmas."

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:18.590
And, well, as you'll see,

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:22.720
it's been updated for our
current circumstances.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.603
Here we go. Gather round, kids.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:29.710
'Twas a while before Christmas,
perhaps a bit longer,

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:33.220
I just traded my Lexapro
for something much stronger.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.670
Our children are feral,
their bedtime's whenever,

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:39.980
we're wiping down Postmates
delivered by Trevor.

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:42.930
The stockings were hung
on the Peloton with care.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:46.480
I know what you're thinking,
but we use it, I swear.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:49.710
The West Coast was burning,
and the politics were mean,

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:52.833
the maskless rose up and spread COVID-19.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:57.070
We marched, and held signs,
and made calls to our reps.

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.820
We all joined Antifa
just to get in our steps.

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:04.110
We clung to our TV sets,
bingeing with shame,

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:05.600
from each streaming service.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.270
We all know their names:

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:08.340
On Netflix.

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:10.610
On Hulu. On Amazon Prime.

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:12.530
Should I sign up for Quibi?

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:15.200
You know what, I'm fine.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.760
When out on the lawn,
there arose such a clatter,

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:20.880
contact-free pizza, so I could get fatter.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.167
Away to the window, I flew like a flash.

00:01:23.167 --> 00:01:26.990
"Leave it on the porch, take
your tip, yes, it's cash."

00:01:26.990 --> 00:01:30.470
Instead, there stood Santa,
who was looking quite round.

00:01:30.470 --> 00:01:33.490
But listen, who hasn't
packed on a few pounds?

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:35.970
I went in for a hug and
he shunned my advances.

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:39.130
He said, "Sorry, bud, but
I can't take any chances."

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:42.660
Then he left in a flurry
of anti-bac spray,

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:46.510
some N-95s where the cookies once lay.

00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:48.930
He yelled, "Everything's
canceled, thanks to COVID-19.

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:51.880
I'll be back next year,
if we have a vaccine."

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:54.580
I stared at the clouds
with a glimmer of hope.

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:58.390
My CNN news alert
replied and said, "Nope."

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:01.167
I dropped to my knees,
wagging fist to the sky,

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:05.337
"Merry Christmas to all,
and to all a good cry."

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:08.533
That's just lovely.

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:12.323
Anyway-
(Andy laughs)

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:17.280
Thanks a lot, Dad.

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:18.910
No problem.

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:21.081
That's gonna kill at the
office Christmas party.

00:02:21.081 --> 00:02:22.620
(Andy laughs)

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:23.873
That's yours to keep.

